WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.680
Last week I received a call from

2
00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:03.120
Simone Giacomelli,

3
00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:04.960
super unexpected call.

4
00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.390
In something like two minutes he

5
00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:08.430
explained me nothing,

6
00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:10.920
but he say come to Frankfurt for

7
00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:12.110
the Inner Shift.

8
00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:13.500
Obviously I say yes.

9
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.180
My name is Francesco Cecchini.

10
00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:16.140
I'm an Italian guy.

11
00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:18.780
I'm 24 years old and I'm the owner

12
00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.160
of my own company.

13
00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:22.350
You can share with these people

14
00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:24.440
deep feelings, deep emotions.

15
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.280
It's really insane

16
00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:28.600
how the connection can start from

17
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.010
basically nothing.

18
00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:31.680
For me it's like a new season.

19
00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:33.160
I'm still the same tree,

20
00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:34.510
but I'm evolving.

21
00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:36.350
The important things are not the

22
00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:38.320
KPI, they are not the score,

23
00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:39.160
the performance,

24
00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.830
you are a good leader if you are a

25
00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:42.270
good human being.
